1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,933
In a tale from

2
00:00:00,933 --> 00:00:02,367
the twelfth century,

3
00:00:02,367 --> 00:00:03,567
a Buddha appears in

4
00:00:03,567 --> 00:00:05,200
a persimmon tree,

5
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,933
shining and
scattering flowers.

6
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:10,733
One minister just
keeps staring.

7
00:00:10,733 --> 00:00:12,833
At last the
Buddha vanishes,

8
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:13,800
and a great kite

9
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:14,967
with a broken wing

10
00:00:14,967 --> 00:00:16,367
falls from the tree.

11
00:00:19,133 --> 00:00:21,133
